# Pong assets
Palette: bg #0b0f1a, fg #e8f1ff, player/accent #00e5ff, computer #ff2e88, dim (centre line) #2a3350. Font: bold "Courier New", monospace.
Audio (22.05 kHz mono 16-bit WAV, generated by tools/make_assets.py): paddle_hit, wall_hit, score, concede, win, lose, start. See manifest.json for use of each file.
Images: img/logo.svg (400x120 title logo), img/favicon.svg. Paddles, ball and court are meant to be drawn as flat rectangles in the palette colours.
